# Skagway manual search index

`manual.ts` is the source of truth. The search corpus is **generated** — never hand-edit `search-index.generated.ts`.

After any content change under `src/app/skagway/manual/`:

1. Run `npm run manual:index` (also runs on `predev` / `prebuild`).
2. Commit `search-index.generated.ts` with the content change.
3. Optionally verify with `npm run manual:index:check`.

See `src/app/skagway/manual/README.md` for the full workflow.
